2:21	compose:content-slot-reused	manual	Content slots should not be reused in different code branches/scopes of a composable function, to preserve the slot internal state.\nYou can wrap the slot in a remember { movableContentOf { ... }} block to make sure their internal state is preserved correctly.\nSee https://mrmans0n.github.io/compose-rules/rules/#content-slots-should-not-be-reused-in-branching-code for more information.
